  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Soon after the update for build 735 there has been an issue with the microphone for some users including myself that have less optimal laptops. Although you could argue that it's because of our less than stellar laptops that cause this issue but before the update for build 735 it has worked perfectly fine. Now ever since the update the microphone would constantly cut the audio it picks up and it results in a choppy inaudible mess. I can hear others fine but nobody can hear me when my microphone glitches out like this. It was last week after the update that this started to occur.",
